      "ar": "اَسْمَاءُ سَيِّدِنَا وَمَوْلَانَا مُحَمَّدٍ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَسَلَّمَ مِائَتَانِ وَوَاحِدٌ وَهِيَ هٰذِهِ",
      "tr": "Asmāʾu sayyidinā wa-mawlānā Muḥammadin ṣallā-Llāhu ʿalayhi wa-sallama miʾatāni wa-wāḥidun wa-hiya hādhihi",
      "en": "The names of our master and patron Muhammad — may Allah bless him and grant him peace — are two hundred and one, and they are these."
