      "tr": "Wa-amitnā ʿalā s-sunnati wa-l-jamāʿati wa-sh-shawqi ilā liqāʾik, yā Dhā l-Jalāli wa-l-Ikrām",
      "en": "and let us die upon the Sunnah, the community, and longing to meet You, O Possessor of Majesty and Generosity."
    },
    {
      "ar": "وَصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلٰى سَيِّدِنَا وَمَوْلَانَا مُحَمَّدٍ وَعَلٰى اٰلِهِ وَصَحْبِهِ وَسَلَّمَ تَسْلِيمًا",
      "tr": "Wa-ṣallā-Llāhu ʿalā sayyidinā wa-mawlānā Muḥammadin wa-ʿalā ālihi wa-ṣaḥbihi wa-sallama taslīmā",
